  "notes": "Covers both still photography and video/film recording. More formal than {撮|と}る, which is the everyday word for taking photos.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {写真|しゃしん}を{撮影|さつえい}する: to take a photo\n- {動画|どうが}を{撮影|さつえい}する: to shoot a video\n- {映画|えいが}の{撮影|さつえい}: film shooting\n- {撮影|さつえい}{禁止|きんし}: photography/filming prohibited\n- {撮影|さつえい}{現場|げんば}: filming location, set\n- {撮影|さつえい}{許可|きょか}: filming/photography permit\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {撮|と}る: to take (a photo) — everyday casual word\n- {録画|ろくが}する: to record (video) — emphasizes the recording/saving aspect\n- {収録|しゅうろく}する: to record (a TV show) — typically in a studio setting",
